| Situation                | Command                               |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| Check running containers | `docker ps`                           |
| Check ALL containers     | `docker ps -a`                        |
| Stop container           | `docker stop <name>`                  |
| Start stopped container  | `docker start <name>`                 |
| Delete container         | `docker rm <name>`                    |
| Build image              | `docker build -t <name> .`            |
| Run container            | `docker run <image>`                  |
| Run in background        | `docker run -d <image>`               |
| Map ports                | `docker run -p 8080:5000 <image>`     |
| Enter container          | `docker exec -it <name> /bin/sh`      |
| See logs                 | `docker logs <name>`                  |
| Delete image             | `docker rmi <image>`                  |
| List images              | `docker images`                       |
| CPU/RAM usage            | `docker stats`                        |
| Tag image                | `docker tag <old> <new>:<tag>`        |
| Export image             | `docker save -o file.tar <image>`     |
| Auto restart             | `docker run --restart=always <image>` |
| Login Docker Hub         | `docker login`                        |
| Upload image             | `docker push <image>`                 |
| Download image           | `docker pull <image>`                 |



